k cafe, resto, atau villa?", "Ya, kami siap mengerjakan proyek dalam jumlah besar. Hubungi kami untuk konsultasi dan jadwal produksi."], ["Berapa lama waktu pengerjaan?", "Tergantung model dan jumlah pesanan. Estimasi waktu produksi akan kami informasikan saat konsultasi."], ["Apakah bisa kirim ke luar kota?", "Bisa. Kami melayani pengiriman ke seluruh Indonesia dengan pengemasan yang aman. Ongkos kirim dihitung sesuai tujuan."], ["Bagaimana cara mengetahui harga?", "Harga tertera di setiap produk dan menyesuaikan ukuran, bahan, serta finishing. Tekan tombol WhatsApp di halaman produk untuk mendapatkan penawaran."]]$q$::jsonb,$q$[["Can I order a custom design?", "Yes. Send a reference photo or your room measurements on WhatsApp and our team will help adjust the design, size and finish."], ["Do you supply cafes, restaurants or villas?", "Yes, we take on large project orders. Contact us for a consultation and production schedule."], ["How long does production take?", "It depends on the model and quantity. We will share the production estimate during the consultation."], ["Can you ship to other cities?", "Yes. We ship across Indonesia with secure packaging. Shipping cost is calculated by destination."], ["How do I find out the price?", "The price is listed on every product and depends on size, material and finish. Tap the WhatsApp button on a product page to get a quote."]]$q$::jsonb),($q$cta_eyebrow$q$,$q$"Sentuhan seni untuk setiap rumah"$q$::jsonb,$q$"A touch of craft for every home"$q$::jsonb),($q$cta_h$q$,$q$"Siap Menghadirkan Kehangatan Jati di Rumah Anda?"$q$::jsonb,$q$"Ready to Bring the Warmth of Teak Into Your Home?"$q$::jsonb),($q$cta_p$q$,$q$"Ceritakan kebutuhan Anda. Kami bantu pilihkan furnitur, ukuran, dan finishing yang tepat."$q$::jsonb,$q$"Tell us what you need. We will help you choose the right furniture, size and finish."$q$::jsonb),($q$cta_btn$q$,$q$"Chat via WhatsApp"$q$::jsonb,$q$"Chat on WhatsApp"$q$::jsonb),($q$f_tag$q$,$q$"Sentuhan seni untuk 